# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repo.
#
# A Windows checkout was rewriting photos-with-tags.txt to CRLF, and the build
# script that reads it strips inline comments with a regex whose dot excludes
# carriage returns — so the strip silently matched nothing, every line survived
# whole, no product code matched, and all 38 price-tagged photos went back on
# sale. The script now splits on either ending, but pinning the checkout removes
# the difference between building here and building on CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
